RR:RE:PO.DN.3 { @ Recommended minimum {{{PO OR SR_DPO} OR DPO} NOT CPO} local density 1. PO.DN.3 rule checks over any 20 um x 20 um area, stepping 10 um. 2. For PO.DN.3 rule, the following regions can be excluded: (1) {Chip corner triangle empty areas SIZING 1 um} if sealring is added by tsmc. (2) {SEALRING_ALL SIZING 1 um} if sealring is added by customer. 3. The rule is applied while width of (checking window NOT ((item 2 SIZING 2.5 um) SIZING -2.5 um)) >= 5 um >= 15% ## Minimum {{{PO OR SR_DPO} OR DPO} NOT CPO} local density 1.PO.DN.3 rules are checked over any 20 um x 20 um area. (Stepping in 10 um increments). 2.For PO.DN.3 rules, the following regions can be excluded: (1) Chip corner stress relief area if seal ring and stress relief pattern added by TSMC. 3.The rule is applied while width of (checking window NOT ((item 2 SIZING 2.5) SIZING -2.5)) >= 5 um. >= 0.1%
  EXC = SEALRING_SIZE_1 OR ICOVL
  N = ALL_POLY NOT EXC
  D = CHIP NOT EXC 
  EXC_M = SIZE EXC BY PO_DN_3_E_R/2 OVERUNDER TRUNCATE PO_DN_3_E_R/2
  A = CHIPx NOT EXC
  B1 = EXC_M NOT WITH EDGE (EXT [EXC_M] < PO_DN_3_E_R*2 SQUARE )
  B = CHIPx NOT (SIZE B1 BY PO_DN_3_E_R-0.001)
  ERR_WIN = DENSITY A B ALL_POLY CHIP N D < PO_DN_3_R WINDOW PO_DN_3_W_R STEP PO_DN_3_S_R BACKUP INSIDE OF LAYER CHIPx 
          [!AREA(B)+~(AREA(A)-PO_DN_3_E_R*PO_DN_3_E_R)*!!(AREA(A)-PO_DN_3_E_R*PO_DN_3_E_R)+AREA(N)/AREA(D)+!~(AREA(ALL_POLY)/AREA(CHIP)-PO_DN_3_R)+!(AREA(ALL_POLY)/AREA(CHIP)-PO_DN_3_R)]
  F = PUSH (WITH WIDTH (ERR_WIN NOT EXC_M) >= PO_DN_3_E_R)
  X = DENSITY A B F ALL_POLY CHIP N D < PO_DN_3_R WINDOW PO_DN_3_W_R STEP PO_DN_3_S_R BACKUP INSIDE OF LAYER CHIPx PRINT PO.DN.3R.density RDB PO.DN.3R.RDB.density
          [!AREA(F)+!AREA(B)+~(AREA(A)-PO_DN_3_E_R*PO_DN_3_E_R)*!!(AREA(A)-PO_DN_3_E_R*PO_DN_3_E_R)+AREA(N)/AREA(D)+!~(AREA(ALL_POLY)/AREA(CHIP)-PO_DN_3_R)+!(AREA(ALL_POLY)/AREA(CHIP)-PO_DN_3_R)]
  X NOT excludeRRuleRecommended
}
